---
// CompanyServices.astro
---

<section class="company-services-section" id="company">
  <div class="company-content" data-reveal>
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">METACHASM</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">We make digital products, specifically apps and websites, among other products.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ks-bento why-bento">
      <article class="ks-bento-tile ks-bento-tile--span-6">
        <span class="ks-bento-num" data-color="kinpaku">01</span>
        <h3 class="why-panel-title">Award-Winning Websites</h3>
        <p class="why-panel-body">We craft immersive, highly interactive web experiences using cutting-edge technologies like WebGL, GSAP, and advanced parallax techniques.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="ks-bento-tile ks-bento-tile--span-6">
        <span class="ks-bento-num" data-color="patina">02</span>
        <h3 class="why-panel-title">Digital Applications</h3>
        <p class="why-panel-body">From complex SaaS dashboards to sleek consumer applications, we build robust, scalable architectures that deliver premium user experiences.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="ks-bento-tile ks-bento-tile--span-12">
        <span class="ks-bento-num" data-color="kinpaku">03</span>
        <h3 class="why-panel-title">End-to-End Product Engineering</h3>
        <p class="why-panel-body">We handle the entire product lifecycle. By bridging the gap between cutting-edge technology and human-centric design, METACHASM creates digital experiences that transcend the ordinary and empower your business.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .company-services-section {
    padding: var(--spacing-2xl) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-mist);
    max-width: var(--width-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: var(--spacing-lg);
    padding-right: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .company-content {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--spacing-xl);
  }
</style>
